{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118848","id":3566939511,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7Umy13","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118848","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118848.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118848.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118848","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118848/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118848/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118848/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/579b5a92ce349563a2ba318f648ada004389d0fb","number":118848,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"[Windows] Fix inconsistent update logic between IME composition and the candidate window","user":{"login":"realybin","id":172874642,"node_id":"U_kgDOCk3bkg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172874642?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/realybin","html_url":"https://github.com/realybin","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realybin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realybin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realybin/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realybin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realybin/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realybin/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realybin/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realybin/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realybin/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Fixes #118834\r\n\r\nBefore:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"498\" height=\"278\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/eacf504b-39fa-49f5-b8b3-948d10f27c3d\" />\r\n\r\nAfter:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"452\" height=\"300\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/42afe9a3-ecca-47de-90f4-b5392589b0e0\" />\r\n\r\nI looked through a lot of code related to IMM, and most implementations follow the same pattern:\r\n\r\n1. Call `ImmSetCompositionWindow` with `CFS_POINT`\r\n2. Call `ImmSetCandidateWindow` with `CFS_CANDIDATEPOS` for compatibility with classic (older) IMEs\r\n3. Call `ImmSetCandidateWindow` with `CFS_EXCLUDE`\r\n\r\nThese are usually applied together to place them in the same location, rather than being used independently.\r\n\r\nSome frameworks check whether the current language is `LANG_ZH` in step 2, and if so, they skip calling `ImmSetCandidateWindow` with `CFS_EXCLUDE`. As mentioned above, this is mainly for compatibility reasons.\r\n\r\nFor step 3, when calling `ImmSetCandidateWindow` with `CFS_EXCLUDE`, the ideal input is a rectangle with some caret margin added. Right now, it is effectively just using a point. The expected usage is a rectangle, but the current behavior still appears to work correctly.\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":205417413,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyMDU0MTc0MTM=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/platform:windows","name":"platform:windows","description":"","color":"e4e4e4","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098255,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyNTU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:platforms","name":"topic:platforms","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":890310664,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw4OTAzMTA2NjQ=","ur